If a tower \(D_s\supseteq\cdots\supseteq D_1\) is constructed, the
smallest disc containing **all** roots of \(g(y)T_1^\psi(y)\) is \(D_i\)
with
\[
i=\max\bigl\{r:\tfrac{V_{r+1}d_r}{d_{r+1}}>V_r\bigr\}.
