If \(\delta_i>-1\), then either \(k[x,y]=k[T_1^\psi,g]=k[f,g]\), or there
exists an automorphism of \(k[x,y]\) reducing the degrees of
\(T_1^\psi(f,g)\), \(g\), and \(f\) simultaneously.

