| `(y,x+y^2)` | (1,2,1) | 1 | 1/2 | 1,3,...,23 | **same** |
| `(y,x+y^3)` | (1,3,1) | 1 | 1/3 | 2,5,...,23 | **same** |
| `(y,x+y^4)` | (1,4,1) | 1 | 1/4 | 3,7,...,23 | **same** |
