+## 0. Custody, blindness, and thesis
+
+The charged packet hash was verified before reading campaign material:
+
+`c90fa6876b069478f658845be6efa2bd056b2e340af7284104af4d042e6c4f95  /tmp/jc2-lane.3XG5jb/inputs/ideation-20260903T1200Z-packet.md`
