+  `RAISE`. The full major tree is the promoted combinatorial backbone. Its
+  role is to compute admissible multiplicity structures, not to certify
+  existence.
+- Row 3, vertex-gap / strip ODEs / residue functional: `RETYPE`. The strip ODE
+  is now node-local sibling algebra. The old residue-functional degree-ceiling
+  reading should be lowered after PS-growth.
+- Row 4, formal-germ certification + algebraization: `RAISE FOR
+  COUNTEREXAMPLE ATTACK`. If a D=108 coefficient witness survives, formal-germ
+  algebraization is the next adversarial test. It is not a broad proof lane
+  without a live coefficient witness.
+- Row 6, Abhyankar-Moh one-place / coordinate recognition: `RAISE /
+  RETYPE`. Moh is the active proof program, but the key obligation is not
+  coordinate recognition alone; it is sibling coefficient realisability across
+  the whole major tree.
+- Row 16, D-module/holonomic index: `LOWER AS PROOF, RETAIN AS EXACT ENGINE`.
+  PS-growth killed the simple D-ceiling hope. Keep exact trace/remainder
+  arithmetic and linear systems.
+- Row 20, reduction mod p / p-curvature: `LOWER`. Use only as modular rank and
+  bad-prime diagnostics for exact coefficient systems.
+- Row 25, fiber monodromy/dessins/Hurwitz passports: `LOWER / KEEP AS
+  PASSPORT SANITY`. The passport screen is useful, but dessin non-existence is
+  not promoted; current evidence leaves excess rows/classes.
+- Row 29, LND/Hamiltonian derivation completeness/commuting frames: `RAISE
+  NARROWLY`. Reinterpret theorem (T) as a monomial-Jacobian derivation/PDE
+  problem `D_P Q = c gamma^k`, not as a free-standing LND slogan.
+- Row 32, off-diagonal collision ideal/injectivity: `RAISE AS SOFTWARE
+  ACCELERATOR`. Once a coefficient witness exists, collision/injectivity
+  ideals are the fastest local falsifier of a putative counterexample.
+- Row 36, guided counterexample search/SAT/fewnomial/sparse: `RAISE /
+  RETARGET`. Search should be directed at the D=108 full-tree survivor group
+  and theorem-(T) descendants, not at random sparse supports.
+- Row 38, tropical geometry beyond Newton polygons: `RAISE MILDLY`. Use
+  tropical initial ideals to schedule coefficient eliminations and detect
+  vanished leaders; do not promote tropical feasibility as existence.
+- Row 45, differential Galois/Liouvillian inverse: `LOWER / MERGE INTO ROW
+  16`. No independent lever appeared. Its useful part is exact remainder and
