+## 5. Reranked bottlenecks
+
+### Proof bottlenecks
+
+1. `OPEN[SIBLING-COEFFICIENTS]`. This is the highest-value bottleneck because
+   it is the first place where promoted necessary tree data can become an
+   actual obstruction. Bounded quantity and cheapest test are in the OPEN
+   register below; the two-row D=108 group is the first target.
+2. `OPEN[DANGER-CLEARING-REALISABILITY]`. This is the first structural lemma I
+   would try to extract from the coefficient compiler. It targets the exact
