+3. `OPEN[THEOREM-T]`. If sibling coefficients survive locally, theorem (T) is
+   the all-degree local obstruction that can still kill them after descent.
+4. `OPEN[MINOR-DICHOTOMY]`. This is needed for `u_s>1` completeness; without
